DP-Bench subset (benchmark/datasets/dpbench)

This directory contains a subset of DP-Bench: Document Parsing Benchmark by Upstage AI
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/upstage/dp-bench, revision
24702c61a2fb13325534be664653bc6e60250d13), converted by benchmark/adapters/dpbench.py.
